## Authority and locks

- Original product, food, adult-model, garment, logo, and brand files are the identity authority for their own subjects.
- Only facts and copy marked approved in `.chany-studio/brief.md` may be treated as final.
- Never invent a price, discount, period, certification, performance claim, comparison, CTA, legal notice, right, or consent.
- Online references contribute art direction only. Do not copy their product, person, packaging, logo, copy, or branded pixels.
- Keep the accepted campaign master as the palette, lighting, material, copy-zone, and crop-safe reference for downstream assets.

