## Skill routing

{{SKILL_ROUTING}}

Use one primary industry skill when the domain is known, then the smallest applicable production skill chain. For work spanning multiple production families, coordinate through `chany-studio`; for one clear output, use its specialist directly.

When `.moai/project/` is named above, treat it as read-only general project context. Never edit `.moai/**`; surface conflicts with this brief instead of silently choosing one source.

When relevant Moai specialist skills are installed, chain only the smallest applicable commerce, marketing, legal, regulatory, or design review step. Preserve the exact Moai skill name and its sources in a structured handoff; do not treat it as blanket clearance or duplicate its command.

